# ClickUp API credentials.
# Generate a personal API token from ClickUp: Settings → Apps → API Token.
CLICKUP_API_TOKEN=pk_your_clickup_token_here

# The MizaniyaPay workspace ("Team") ID.
# Find it in the ClickUp URL: app.clickup.com/<WORKSPACE_ID>/...
CLICKUP_WORKSPACE_ID=90121232813

# Optional: comma-separated ClickUp List IDs to scope the sync to.
# MizaniyaPay's workspace has 30+ sprint/backlog lists with thousands of
# granular tickets — most have no dates set. Pointing this at your
# release/feature-planning lists keeps the roadmap to scheduled,
# feature-level work instead of every raw dev ticket. Recommended defaults
# for this workspace (Release Pipeline, Features Hub, Product Management
# Space):
CLICKUP_LIST_IDS=901213119469,901217505734,901218217445

# Leave CLICKUP_API_TOKEN / CLICKUP_WORKSPACE_ID unset to run the dashboard
# fully in mock mode against the realistic MizaniyaPay seed data in
# lib/clickup/mock-data.ts.
